# Build output and packaged releases.
build/
dist/
*.log

# Python bytecode from the offset tooling.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Bulk extracts from the game's own files.
#
# These are regenerable on any machine that owns Sifu, are not needed to build
# or run the mod, and are wholesale copies of data the developers ship for
# debugging rather than as documentation -- symbols.txt alone is six megabytes
# of private symbol names lifted out of the shipped PDB. Keeping them local is
# the polite line to draw when publishing something that interoperates with
# somebody else's game.
#
# tools/pdbdump regenerates any of it in about two seconds; see the README.
# The whole directory is these regenerable symbol/workflow extracts, so none of
# it is tracked.
research/

# Never commit a game binary, PDB or pak.
*.exe
*.pdb
*.pak
!dist/tools/*.exe
